    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The 98.7% number sounds good, but I'm more concerned about systemic blind spots. Are we absolutely certain the scanning engine itself hasn't been compromised or that there isn't some way for an advanced threat to bypass it entirely without leaving a footprint? I need to know if we can trust the data the tools are giving us.",
